{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2023-06-13 11:50:00', 'title': 'VANDERBILT UNIVERSITY, PEPSI AND METRO NASHVILLE PARKS AND RECREATION TO OPEN NEW COMMUNITY BASKETBALL COURT IN NORTH NASHVILLE', 'text': 'NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VANDERBILT UNIVERSITY IS COLLABORATING WITH PEPSI, HOOPBUS AND METRO NASHVILLE PARKS AND RECREATION TO INTRODUCE AN ALL-NEW OUTDOOR BASKETBALL COURT AT WATKINS PARK IN NORTH NASHVILLE. THE NEW COURT WILL DEBUT AT THE “HOOPS AND HOPE CELEBRATING BLACK HISTORY AND COMMUNITY” GRAND OPENING EVENT, A CELEBRATION OF THE RESILIENCE, CREATIVITY AND HOPE OF THE NORTH NASHVILLE COMMUNITY ON THURSDAY, JUNE 15, 11 A.M.-5 P.M. CT. THE EVENT WILL ALSO SERVE AS AN EARLY JUNE.'}